onment variables for credential sync (CALCOM_WEBHOOK_SECRET, CALCOM_WEBHOOK_HEADER_NAME, CALCOM_CREDENTIAL_SYNC_ENDPOINT, CALCOM_APP_CREDENTIAL_ENCRYPTION_KEY) expand configuration surface area and require proper docs": 0.23925699293613434, "Potential unhandled promise rejections in async token refresh flows that may not propagate errors to callers in all code paths": 0.7051084637641907}